WEBVTT

00:09.009 --> 00:11.010
Kugisaki, don't touch his blood.

00:11.094 --> 00:12.929
I know--

00:15.515 --> 00:17.434
Run.

00:17.517 --> 00:19.352
Run with your back against me.

00:24.399 --> 00:26.818
Kugisaki, can you run faster?

00:26.901 --> 00:27.902
I can't!

00:35.285 --> 00:36.536
I'll have your back.

00:37.328 --> 00:38.496
Thanks a lot.

00:40.457 --> 00:41.791
What?

00:48.923 --> 00:52.343
What terrifying speed.
He was carrying a person, too.

00:56.431 --> 00:57.432
Damn it.

00:57.515 --> 00:59.059
They are going to escape.

00:59.142 --> 01:00.351
Forget it.

01:13.990 --> 01:16.034
Good. We're out of range, right?

01:16.951 --> 01:19.621
Well done. You have my praise.

01:19.704 --> 01:21.039
Whatever you say.

01:21.122 --> 01:23.041
Just kidding. Thank you.

01:23.124 --> 01:24.334
What?

01:30.465 --> 01:32.884
Did he take the shortest route
to ambush us?

01:32.967 --> 01:34.677
Itadori--

01:40.850 --> 01:41.976
Kugisaki!

01:42.477 --> 01:44.354
Don't worry.

01:44.437 --> 01:48.316
My brother's blood
has different properties than mine.

01:48.858 --> 01:54.781
Even my blood is not lethal
unless you get it all over your body.

01:54.864 --> 01:58.118
But it's going to hurt like hell.

01:58.618 --> 02:02.288
Our cursed technique
is only about to begin.

02:02.372 --> 02:04.040
Rot Technique…

02:04.958 --> 02:06.042
Decay.

02:12.298 --> 02:13.299
What…

03:44.849 --> 03:47.685
Membranes, wounds…

03:47.769 --> 03:51.064
If you're hit with our blood

03:51.147 --> 03:54.984
and one of us uses the cursed technique,

03:55.068 --> 03:58.529
that part of your body
will start to decompose.

03:59.030 --> 04:02.200
That boy can last for 15 minutes at most.

04:02.283 --> 04:05.453
And you, perhaps ten minutes?

04:06.329 --> 04:09.249
You two will turn
into skeletons by morning.

04:09.832 --> 04:11.834
If this is a cursed technique,

04:11.918 --> 04:14.128
all I have to do is to undo it.

04:14.796 --> 04:16.130
So it's really poison?

04:16.214 --> 04:19.008
Poison is the end result.

04:19.092 --> 04:23.137
After all, our cursed technique
is only decomposition.

04:23.221 --> 04:25.723
My explanation
of the cursed technique is over.

04:25.807 --> 04:28.643
They will die faster than my prediction.

04:29.227 --> 04:31.729
Now what will you do?

04:32.730 --> 04:36.150
Brother, these people are nothing special.

04:37.360 --> 04:38.987
In the Meiji Era,

04:39.070 --> 04:42.448
there was a girl who bore a child
born of Cursed Spirit and human.

04:42.532 --> 04:44.951
Due to her unexplained pregnancy,

04:45.034 --> 04:47.745
she was ostracized by her family.

04:47.829 --> 04:49.956
She fled to a temple
run by a Jujutsu Sorcerer

04:50.039 --> 04:53.084
with her baby's corpse in her arms.

04:53.584 --> 04:57.672
But at that very moment,
she ran out of luck.

04:58.339 --> 04:59.841
Noritoshi Kamo.

04:59.924 --> 05:02.010
Knowledgeable about curses and Jujutsu,

05:02.093 --> 05:04.345
he is known
as the evilest sorcerer in history,

05:04.429 --> 05:06.222
and the disgrace of the Great Families.

05:06.306 --> 05:08.141
His immense curiosity

05:08.224 --> 05:11.477
made him obsessed with children
born of both Cursed Spirit and human.

05:12.061 --> 05:14.897
Nine pregnancies, nine abortions.

05:14.981 --> 05:19.444
How did the process go?
What happened to those women?

05:19.527 --> 05:21.654
All these records were erased.

05:22.780 --> 05:25.700
Cursed Womb: Death Paintings 1 to 3.

05:25.783 --> 05:28.369
They are classified
as Special Grade Cursed Relics.

05:28.453 --> 05:32.165
Do their cursed energy originate
from their mother's grudge?

05:32.248 --> 05:33.207
Or…

05:33.291 --> 05:35.585
I don't remember anything about my mother.

05:36.461 --> 05:38.713
I also have born no hatred

05:38.796 --> 05:41.924
towards humans or Jujutsu Sorcerers.

05:42.425 --> 05:44.343
For 150 years,

05:45.178 --> 05:49.098
we relied on each other
to endure the seal placed on us.

05:49.182 --> 05:51.350
We'll side with the Cursed Spirits.

05:51.434 --> 05:53.436
Will it be okay?

05:53.519 --> 05:55.855
He looks quite suspicious, Choso.

05:56.522 --> 05:58.816
The future painted by this Cursed Spirit

05:58.900 --> 06:01.360
is more beneficial to us.

06:01.944 --> 06:03.905
That's all.

06:03.988 --> 06:06.324
Don't be grateful to them
for our incarnation.

06:06.407 --> 06:08.367
Brothers, listen carefully.

06:08.951 --> 06:10.870
Eso lives for Kechizu,

06:10.953 --> 06:13.372
Kechizu lives for me,

06:13.456 --> 06:15.875
and I live for Eso.

06:16.751 --> 06:20.379
The three of us are one entity.

06:20.463 --> 06:22.256
For my brothers,

06:22.340 --> 06:24.092
if this is their wish,

06:24.175 --> 06:27.136
then I'm willing to sacrifice my life.

06:27.220 --> 06:32.308
If this is too painful,
I can relieve your agony now.

06:32.809 --> 06:33.643
What?

06:34.227 --> 06:38.147
So you win once your cursed technique
lands on your mark.

06:38.231 --> 06:39.899
But what a shame.

06:40.483 --> 06:43.569
That's a bad match against me!

06:44.153 --> 06:45.404
Straw Doll Technique…

06:46.364 --> 06:47.406
Resonance!

06:51.369 --> 06:53.371
Let's have a game of endurance, shall we?

06:54.288 --> 06:55.873
You guys don't like pain, right?

06:56.791 --> 06:59.877
Then start crying
and undo the cursed technique!

07:01.963 --> 07:04.132
A curse used to counter techniques?

07:04.215 --> 07:06.092
A game of endurance?

07:06.175 --> 07:09.971
If we don't undo it,
this situation will continue?

07:11.264 --> 07:13.057
Straw Doll Technique: Resonance.

07:13.724 --> 07:18.771
It applies cursed energy to inflict damage

07:18.855 --> 07:21.732
to an opponent's targeted body part.

07:22.525 --> 07:25.027
The effective range is wide,
and the ability difference

07:25.111 --> 07:26.988
between the user and the target

07:27.071 --> 07:29.991
as well as the targeted body part
affects skill potency.

07:30.825 --> 07:34.829
In Straw Doll Technique,
the value of blood isn't high.

07:35.580 --> 07:36.622
However,

07:36.706 --> 07:39.584
Resonance activates
on a connection to the target.

07:40.376 --> 07:44.005
Now their blood and mine are tied together

07:44.088 --> 07:48.009
thanks to the Rot Technique
they used on me.

07:48.718 --> 07:51.888
Luckily, it's also effective
on the younger brother.

07:51.971 --> 07:53.973
I'm going to die in the end anyway.

07:54.724 --> 07:57.477
It's better to go on the offensive!

07:58.019 --> 08:00.563
Although it is quite powerful,

08:00.646 --> 08:04.150
it's still not enough to kill us
no matter how often she activates it.

08:04.233 --> 08:07.945
As long as we endure,
you will be the first one to die.

08:08.029 --> 08:09.489
When Decay is activated,

08:09.572 --> 08:14.160
the pain from the Rot Technique
will make it difficult for you to move--

08:18.581 --> 08:20.500
Why is he moving freely?

08:23.920 --> 08:24.837
Resonance.

08:30.384 --> 08:34.722
Itadori is the vessel of Ryomen Sukuna,
the King of Deadly Poisons.

08:35.264 --> 08:38.142
Thus, he is immune to all kinds of poison.

08:38.726 --> 08:41.312
Poison is the end result.

08:41.395 --> 08:45.816
After all, our cursed technique
is only decomposition.

08:45.900 --> 08:48.194
Although there is pain
caused by decomposition,

08:48.277 --> 08:50.821
the end result of poison
is ineffective against him.

08:50.905 --> 08:52.990
But mere pain…

08:57.203 --> 08:58.913
will not stop…

09:01.499 --> 09:03.000
Yuji Itadori!

09:07.838 --> 09:09.924
Kechizu!

09:10.883 --> 09:12.677
You're so noisy!

09:12.760 --> 09:15.054
-Resonance!
-What?

09:17.974 --> 09:19.850
They switched positions?

09:19.934 --> 09:21.269
Is he making a dying woman

09:21.352 --> 09:23.938
attack my younger brother,
who's dying faster?

09:24.021 --> 09:26.315
Do you think you can stop
my actions at any time?

09:27.900 --> 09:29.986
Hey, you woman!

09:30.069 --> 09:32.280
Should I undo my cursed technique?

09:32.363 --> 09:34.699
I can't save my brother if this continues.

09:34.782 --> 09:37.785
If I activate Decay,
I can't use Wing King.

09:37.868 --> 09:42.707
But does that woman have enough energy
to kill my brother now?

09:44.000 --> 09:45.751
Even if she gets in the way,

09:45.835 --> 09:50.548
I won't get killed by this guy
before she dies.

09:51.132 --> 09:54.510
I will never undo the cursed technique!

09:55.261 --> 09:57.346
Eso…

09:58.222 --> 10:01.350
The three of us are one entity.

10:12.320 --> 10:15.239
I undid
the cursed technique instinctively.

10:19.327 --> 10:20.369
Wing King!

11:01.160 --> 11:04.997
What was that black light just now?

11:06.457 --> 11:07.792
I'm sure that

11:07.875 --> 11:11.379
I used my arm to block his fist
that was covered in cursed energy.

11:12.296 --> 11:15.716
But before I knew it,
my entire arm was cut off.

11:15.800 --> 11:17.968
Kechizu…

11:18.052 --> 11:20.471
Don't die, Kechizu.

11:22.264 --> 11:24.892
Eso!

11:28.312 --> 11:32.233
I think I haven't shown you this trick.

11:37.113 --> 11:38.322
Hairpin.

11:43.452 --> 11:45.162
Don't worry.

11:46.080 --> 11:49.083
I'll send your brother
to accompany you right away.

11:50.876 --> 11:52.169
Kechizu…

11:52.753 --> 11:57.007
The three of us are one entity.

11:57.883 --> 12:00.052
I'm sorry, Choso.

12:00.136 --> 12:02.304
I was right by his side, and yet…

12:03.889 --> 12:05.766
Why didn't he disappear?

12:05.850 --> 12:07.309
Is he still alive?

12:07.393 --> 12:08.477
No!

12:08.561 --> 12:11.480
He's not a Cursed Spirit!
He has a physical body.

12:15.860 --> 12:17.278
It's dangerous!

12:17.361 --> 12:18.946
For god's sake.

12:19.572 --> 12:20.823
What?

12:21.740 --> 12:23.367
Mr. Sawamura!

12:23.451 --> 12:25.619
-Drive faster.
-What?

12:25.703 --> 12:29.123
I'll kill you both
if you step on the brakes.

12:29.790 --> 12:31.083
Do you understand?

12:39.800 --> 12:42.219
Don't chase after me, Jujutsu Sorcerers.

12:42.845 --> 12:47.683
I'll kill them both when I recover.
Especially that woman.

12:47.766 --> 12:49.643
I'm sorry, Kechizu.

12:49.727 --> 12:51.187
I can't even grieve over you.

12:51.270 --> 12:54.398
But I will take revenge.

12:55.608 --> 12:58.027
What is that woman doing?

12:58.110 --> 12:59.528
Kugisaki!

13:02.198 --> 13:04.992
Don't rush me!

13:05.576 --> 13:07.161
Straw Doll Technique…

13:08.162 --> 13:10.289
Resonance!

13:20.883 --> 13:22.510
After using Black Flash,

13:22.593 --> 13:27.515
a sorcerer will enter the zone,
similar to what athletes experience.

13:29.600 --> 13:32.728
Darn it!

13:32.811 --> 13:36.023
That wasn't just a counter technique?

13:39.860 --> 13:40.819
I'm sorry.

14:01.173 --> 14:02.508
It hurts.

14:07.596 --> 14:09.014
Geto, stock.

14:09.598 --> 14:11.850
-What's wrong, Choso?
-Hurry up.

14:13.310 --> 14:15.813
Hey! Don't smash the chess piece!

14:15.896 --> 14:17.982
My brothers died.

14:18.065 --> 14:20.067
So you can sense this kind of thing?

14:20.150 --> 14:21.986
What happened?

14:22.069 --> 14:24.530
I can understand
if it's a fully fleshed Cursed Spirit,

14:24.613 --> 14:28.158
but I don't think they could be defeated
by a curse that swallowed one finger.

14:28.242 --> 14:30.703
-Wait a minute.
-I can't find one.

14:30.786 --> 14:32.872
Why did you break it, anyway?

14:33.914 --> 14:35.791
I got the report.

14:35.875 --> 14:38.335
Eso and Kechizu were killed by

14:38.419 --> 14:40.254
Jujutsu High first-years,

14:40.337 --> 14:43.507
Yuji Itadori and his classmate.

14:49.346 --> 14:51.265
SUGINAMI 385
64-355

14:53.976 --> 14:57.187
The number you dialed
cannot be reached at the moment…

14:57.271 --> 14:59.064
They still won't pick up!

14:59.148 --> 15:01.442
Where did those brats go?

15:04.528 --> 15:06.447
Kugisaki, are you okay?

15:06.530 --> 15:08.741
Yes, I guess so.

15:08.824 --> 15:10.784
But it may leave scars.

15:11.285 --> 15:14.204
Is that old man okay? He just drove away.

15:14.288 --> 15:17.249
As for the poison…

15:17.333 --> 15:19.543
When we get back,
will Ms. Shoko still be awake?

15:19.627 --> 15:21.003
Will she even be sober?

15:21.921 --> 15:24.465
Why are you fidgeting? It's gross.

15:25.215 --> 15:27.384
I wonder if this is your first time

15:28.010 --> 15:30.304
killing someone
instead of exorcising them.

15:30.804 --> 15:31.972
What about you?

15:32.556 --> 15:33.807
I did it once.

15:33.891 --> 15:38.270
No, that would be misleading.
I killed three people.

15:38.354 --> 15:41.440
You are doing much worse than me.

15:42.775 --> 15:45.027
Frankly speaking, I don't feel anything.

15:45.110 --> 15:47.488
This is normal
for a Jujutsu Sorcerer, right?

15:48.489 --> 15:50.491
Not to quote Fushiguro,

15:50.574 --> 15:53.744
but there are only
so many people we can save.

15:54.870 --> 15:57.915
My opinion is, well…

15:57.998 --> 16:02.670
People who are not involved in my life
should not affect how I do things.

16:03.587 --> 16:04.672
Am I cold?

16:05.464 --> 16:10.302
But there are also people like you
doing whatever they want.

16:11.887 --> 16:13.806
I'm not trying to comfort you,

16:13.889 --> 16:17.101
but we had no time to check if
they were Cursed Spirits or Curse Users.

16:17.601 --> 16:19.061
Even if the opponent is a human,

16:19.144 --> 16:22.314
we're not capable of trapping
opponents of that level for long.

16:22.398 --> 16:23.691
You know it, don't you?

16:24.274 --> 16:29.029
But he cried when his brother
died in front of him.

16:30.447 --> 16:31.657
I see.

16:32.366 --> 16:36.453
I'm so glad that you and I survived.

16:36.537 --> 16:37.788
I feel so relieved.

16:38.747 --> 16:44.169
Even so, someone cried over a life I took.

16:45.379 --> 16:46.380
That's all.

16:47.798 --> 16:49.216
I see.

16:49.299 --> 16:52.720
Then that makes us accomplices.

16:55.389 --> 16:57.307
-Fushiguro?
-Fushiguro?

16:59.309 --> 17:01.020
Hey. You guys are back.

17:01.103 --> 17:02.688
I'm glad you're all right.

17:02.771 --> 17:04.690
That gave us a fright!

17:04.773 --> 17:06.442
We thought you were dead.

17:06.525 --> 17:07.818
We're so relieved!

17:08.402 --> 17:10.112
Please lower down your voices.

17:10.738 --> 17:11.822
My head hurts.

17:12.406 --> 17:14.700
Don't fall asleep with Sukuna's finger.

17:14.783 --> 17:15.826
It's too dangerous.

17:16.744 --> 17:18.704
How did you know about the finger?

17:18.787 --> 17:20.831
Do you have the energy to hear me out?

17:20.914 --> 17:24.293
No. Anyway, contact Ms. Nitta first.

17:24.376 --> 17:27.838
It must be sealed immediately
or Cursed Spirits will gather.

17:27.921 --> 17:29.923
Shall I eat them instead?

17:30.007 --> 17:31.925
They are not leftovers.

17:32.009 --> 17:34.636
We don't know
how many more fingers you can eat.

17:35.262 --> 17:36.346
Don't eat it.

17:36.430 --> 17:39.349
But take it
since you seem the least worn out.

17:40.017 --> 17:41.852
Let me remind you again. Don't eat it.

17:41.935 --> 17:45.355
He talks to me like I'm a dog.

17:49.401 --> 17:50.277
What?

17:54.239 --> 17:55.657
We told you not to eat it!

17:55.741 --> 17:56.992
Why is it my fault?

17:57.076 --> 17:58.786
This guy is too much.

17:58.869 --> 18:01.789
He's not helpful at all this time.

18:02.581 --> 18:04.875
The Sukuna in you
will tell us where they are

18:04.958 --> 18:07.336
since he wants to regain his powers.

18:08.003 --> 18:10.631
Don't tell me Mr. Gojo spouts nonsense?

18:10.714 --> 18:12.091
You just realized that?

18:12.174 --> 18:14.927
Hey, you guys!

18:15.010 --> 18:17.471
-What have you guys been up to?
-Ms. Nitta.

18:17.554 --> 18:19.473
-She's mad.
-You didn't pick up the phone.

18:19.556 --> 18:21.350
Explain it to me!

18:21.433 --> 18:24.812
-Can't you contact me?
-All right, let's go back.

18:24.895 --> 18:26.688
-Report, contact, discuss!
-I'm hungry.

18:26.772 --> 18:29.108
-Are you listening?
-Is there a Rippa Sushi nearby?

18:29.191 --> 18:31.318
-Answer me!
-Rippa Sushi in Shinkansen is good.

18:31.401 --> 18:32.361
You're so annoying.

18:33.779 --> 18:36.740
Man! It wasn't just
a Cursed Spirit with a finger.

18:36.824 --> 18:38.867
I was shocked
after investigating the remains!

18:38.951 --> 18:42.204
It turned out to be a vessel
of the Cursed Relic!

18:43.080 --> 18:45.916
They defeated opponents equivalent
to a Special Grade.

18:45.999 --> 18:48.210
The first-years got it big.

18:48.293 --> 18:52.005
Is my coaching ability too good?

18:52.089 --> 18:55.467
I don't want to waste my holiday
talking to you.

18:55.551 --> 18:57.511
You want to ask about the party, right?

18:57.594 --> 18:59.221
So did you find it?

18:59.304 --> 19:00.639
Not at all.

19:00.722 --> 19:02.891
Everyone's too busy, including me.

19:02.975 --> 19:05.644
Well? Should I ask the students?

19:05.727 --> 19:09.231
I can't drink,
so nonalcoholic drinks are fine with me.

19:09.314 --> 19:12.025
Please continue to search for it.

19:13.277 --> 19:16.196
UTAHIME IORI

19:16.989 --> 19:20.576
After all, I don't know
if anyone's eavesdropping on her.

19:21.243 --> 19:22.619
I don't want to think about

19:22.703 --> 19:24.663
the possibility of a student
being the mole.

19:25.497 --> 19:27.166
It's so annoying.

19:28.000 --> 19:31.170
Well then, I leave the rest to you, Mei.

19:36.216 --> 19:38.135
SATORU GOJO, 10 MILLION YEN

19:38.218 --> 19:40.137
CASH CARD ATM

19:40.929 --> 19:43.140
Don't tell Itadori
about the fingers resonating.

19:43.932 --> 19:45.601
Are you sure about that?

19:45.684 --> 19:46.852
I'm quite sure.

19:46.935 --> 19:48.145
The case is closed.

19:49.104 --> 19:53.525
Probably only Ms. Nitta and us
would notice this.

19:54.735 --> 19:58.447
Itadori only became
Sukuna's vessel by chance.

19:58.530 --> 20:02.201
The Yasohachi Bridge deaths
were bound to happen sooner or later.

20:03.243 --> 20:07.164
In the first place,
he swallowed the finger to save me.

20:07.998 --> 20:10.667
But he won't be happy
with that explanation.

20:11.376 --> 20:12.669
So don't tell him.

20:13.253 --> 20:14.588
I won't tell him.

20:14.671 --> 20:16.256
As a lady, I'm considerate.

20:17.132 --> 20:18.675
This is all your fault!

20:18.759 --> 20:20.928
Because you ate me,

20:21.011 --> 20:24.973
my scattered soul is awakened.

20:26.183 --> 20:28.685
Do you want to save
as many people as possible?

20:28.769 --> 20:29.895
Brat!

20:29.978 --> 20:32.898
Those people die because of you!

20:32.981 --> 20:35.442
Hey, don't tell Fushiguro about this.

20:36.151 --> 20:40.239
What if the person you saved
takes someone else's life later?

20:42.199 --> 20:43.242
Don't you dare.

20:55.921 --> 20:56.838
Leaf mustard.

20:57.547 --> 20:59.967
What's wrong? Your movements seem dull.

21:00.050 --> 21:01.093
Did you become weak?

21:01.176 --> 21:02.594
Shut up!

21:02.678 --> 21:05.097
My body's just weak after resting.

21:05.180 --> 21:09.184
Speaking of which, have you heard
about the first-year students?

21:09.268 --> 21:10.102
Yes.

21:10.185 --> 21:13.605
They exorcised
three Special Grade equivalents, right?

21:13.689 --> 21:14.856
Salmon.

21:16.817 --> 21:18.193
Well then…

21:18.277 --> 21:21.488
We can't lose to them.

21:21.571 --> 21:23.991
-Salted fish roe!
-Yes!

21:24.825 --> 21:26.034
What?

21:27.494 --> 21:29.830
Was that your full strength?

21:29.913 --> 21:31.999
If it wasn't, then it's not training!

21:32.082 --> 21:32.916
Kelp.

21:33.000 --> 21:39.423
Special Grades are anomalies
among Jujutsu Sorcerers.

21:39.506 --> 21:43.802
I believe that Grade 1 Sorcerers
uphold the standards

21:43.885 --> 21:48.432
of the strongest sorcerers,
and are suitable leaders of our society.

21:48.515 --> 21:51.727
The level of danger,
confidentiality, and involvement…

21:51.810 --> 21:54.438
It is incomparable below Semi-Grade 1.

21:54.521 --> 21:57.441
And yet, what did you say just now?

21:57.524 --> 21:59.943
Maki Zenin, Panda…

22:00.027 --> 22:02.946
Megumi Fushiguro, Nobara Kugisaki,

22:03.030 --> 22:06.950
and my brother, Yuji Itadori,

22:07.034 --> 22:09.453
in the name of Aoi Todo…

22:09.536 --> 22:11.955
And in the name of Mei Mei…

22:12.039 --> 22:15.000
…we recommend them
to be promoted to Grade 1 Sorcerers.

22:22.716 --> 22:25.010
Don't you think you bought too much?

22:25.093 --> 22:26.762
Half of it belongs to you.

22:26.845 --> 22:29.181
My things are in this single bag!

22:29.264 --> 22:30.432
Oh, god!

22:32.559 --> 22:33.477
What?

22:33.560 --> 22:35.729
If you dare drop any of those bags,

22:36.271 --> 22:37.481
I will kill you.

22:37.564 --> 22:39.399
Yes, madam.

22:39.483 --> 22:40.484
What?

22:47.532 --> 22:50.535
I told you,
I would kill you if you dropped any of it!

22:50.619 --> 22:52.704
I'm sorry, I didn't mean it!

22:52.788 --> 22:55.957
-You should take at least one bag.
-How will you pay me if it breaks?

22:56.541 --> 22:57.459
I'm Fushiguro.

22:58.085 --> 23:00.170
Yes, okay.

23:00.921 --> 23:02.923
I got it. I'll hang up now.

23:04.341 --> 23:05.258
What's wrong?

23:05.342 --> 23:08.220
Mr. Gojo wants to see us.

23:08.303 --> 23:10.097
What? Why?

23:10.639 --> 23:11.848
It's a new mission.

23:11.932 --> 23:13.517
And a confidential one to boot.

23:13.600 --> 23:14.601
What?

23:14.684 --> 23:16.978
We just finished up one.

23:17.062 --> 23:18.021
Isn't this fine?

23:18.605 --> 23:21.316
Mr. Gojo just said that
it's a confidential mission.

23:21.399 --> 23:22.901
It must be interesting.

23:23.485 --> 23:24.903
He says that often.

23:24.986 --> 23:26.905
He always talks about it.

23:26.988 --> 23:29.783
Oh, well!

23:31.910 --> 23:32.953
Let's go.

23:39.960 --> 23:40.794
TO BE CONTINUED
